###Pure
Class demo::m2m::concatenatePassThrough::In  { v: String[1]; }
Class demo::m2m::concatenatePassThrough::Sub { s: String[1]; }
Class demo::m2m::concatenatePassThrough::Mid { first: demo::m2m::concatenatePassThrough::Sub[0..1]; second: demo::m2m::concatenatePassThrough::Sub[0..1]; }
Class demo::m2m::concatenatePassThrough::Out { picks: demo::m2m::concatenatePassThrough::Sub[*]; }

###Mapping
Mapping demo::m2m::concatenatePassThrough::SubBMapping ( demo::m2m::concatenatePassThrough::Sub[subB]: Pure { ~src demo::m2m::concatenatePassThrough::In  s: $src.v + '-B' } )

###Mapping
Mapping demo::m2m::concatenatePassThrough::StepA
(
  include demo::m2m::concatenatePassThrough::SubBMapping
  *demo::m2m::concatenatePassThrough::Mid: Pure { ~src demo::m2m::concatenatePassThrough::In  first[subA]: $src, second[subB]: $src }
  demo::m2m::concatenatePassThrough::Sub[subA]: Pure { ~src demo::m2m::concatenatePassThrough::In  s: $src.v + '-A' }
)

###Mapping
Mapping demo::m2m::concatenatePassThrough::StepB
(
  *demo::m2m::concatenatePassThrough::Out: Pure { ~src demo::m2m::concatenatePassThrough::Mid  picks: $src.first->concatenate($src.second) }
)

###Connection
ModelChainConnection demo::m2m::concatenatePassThrough::Chain { mappings: [ demo::m2m::concatenatePassThrough::StepA ]; }

###Runtime
Runtime demo::m2m::concatenatePassThrough::Rt
{
  mappings: [ demo::m2m::concatenatePassThrough::StepB ];
  connections: [ ModelStore: [ chain: demo::m2m::concatenatePassThrough::Chain, c1: #{ JsonModelConnection { class: demo::m2m::concatenatePassThrough::In; url: 'data:application/json,${inJson}'; } }# ] ];
}

###Service
Service demo::m2m::concatenatePassThrough::Svc
{
  pattern: '/m2mConcatenatePassThrough'; owners: [ 'test' ]; documentation: 'M2M reads class-typed properties from both inputs of a concatenate over a chained source';
  autoActivateUpdates: true;
  execution: Single
  {
    query: {inJson: String[1] | demo::m2m::concatenatePassThrough::Out.all()->graphFetch(#{demo::m2m::concatenatePassThrough::Out{picks{s}}}#)->serialize(#{demo::m2m::concatenatePassThrough::Out{picks{s}}}#, ^meta::pure::graphFetch::execution::AlloySerializationConfig(typeKeyName='@type', includeType=false, removePropertiesWithNullValues=true, removePropertiesWithEmptySets=true))->from(demo::m2m::concatenatePassThrough::StepB, demo::m2m::concatenatePassThrough::Rt)};
  }
  testSuites:
  [
    s1:
    {
      data: []
      tests:
      [
        concatenateReturnsBothInputs:
        {
          serializationFormat: PURE;
          parameters: [ inJson = '{"v":"x"}' ]
          asserts: [ x: EqualToJson #{ expected: ExternalFormat #{ contentType: 'application/json'; data: '{"picks":[{"s":"x-A"},{"s":"x-B"}]}'; }#; }# ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
